Subject: [PATCH 13/20] gluon-core: check if device_supports_band instead of
 usage to evaluate if a default config should be created

---
 .../luasrc/lib/gluon/upgrade/022-wireless-roles    |  2 +-
 .../luasrc/usr/lib/lua/gluon/wireless.lua          | 14 ++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/package/gluon-core/luasrc/lib/gluon/upgrade/022-wireless-roles b/package/gluon-core/luasrc/lib/gluon/upgrade/022-wireless-roles
