From 62c063b9105014c7cfa7c0234183ddebde7cb010 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Florian Maurer <f.maurer@outlook.de>
Date: Tue, 30 Sep 2025 00:52:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/20] configure 6ghz with open SSID instead of OWE ssid

The configured SSID to broadcast needs to be the open, as otherwise you end up with two SSID for the same network in the scan list.

Transition networks are hidden identified by the matching relation thru the transition IE. This is not available on 6GHz, thus the broadcasted SSID of the OWE network on 6GHz needs to be the Open SSID on a/g band.
